## Success Criteria

- [ ] Session trigger fills 1-3 gaps per query (when coverage < 80%)
- [ ] Outcome trigger produces corrected vector on every wrong prediction
- [ ] Continuous trigger refreshes 3-5 stale facts daily
- [ ] All distilled knowledge passes anti-hallucination verification
- [ ] Dedup prevents duplicate vectors (< 1% duplication rate)
- [ ] Budget cap enforced: max $1/day across all triggers combined
- [ ] Evolution metrics tracked: vectors_added_per_day, domains_improved, accuracy_trend

## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Triggers over-query LLM (cost) | Hard budget cap in llm-config.json ($10/day), per-trigger limits |
| Distilled corrections introduce noise | Quality gate: only store verified facts with confidence >= 0.7 |
| Session trigger slows down stage0 | Async: fire-and-forget, don't block verdict |
| Continuous trigger runs on stale topics | Coverage tracker prioritizes low-coverage + recent-query domains |
